6',NULL,37.32800037,127.98977231,'http://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/18/2701318_image2_1.jpg',NULL,'2026-11-06 00:48:43'),(20579,2687879,'윤가네김밥',39,32,9,'강원특별자치도 원주시 황금로 2 메가박스1층 114호 윤가네김밥',NULL,37.32784200,127.98660316,'http://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/20/2701320_image2_1.jpg',NULL,'2026-11-06 00:48:43'),(20580,2687880,'교동쌈밥',39,35,11,'경상북도 안동시 경동로 859-4',NULL,36.56027498,128.75078489,'http://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/79/2684379_image2_1.jpg',NULL,'2026-11-06 00:48:43'),(20581,2687881,'365 메가분식',39,32,9,'강원특별자치도 원주시 황금로 2',NULL,37.32784200,127.98660316,'http://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/21/2701321_image2_1.jpg',NULL,'2026-11-06 00:48:43'),(20582,2687882,'구서울갈비 도청',39,35,11,'경상북도 안동시 풍천면 풍요6길 17-2',NULL,36.57599624,128.49906791,'http://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/81/2684381_image2_1.jpg',NULL,'2026-11-06 00:48:43'),(20583,2687886,'한우연',39,32,12,'강원특별자치도 철원군 동송읍 금학로136번길 9',NULL,38.20180128,127.22276365,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-06 00:48:43'),(20584,2687891,'본심오향족발',39,32,9,'강원특별자치도 원주시 버들만이길 2-1',NULL,37.31984824,127.97403508,'http://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/29/2701329_image2_1.jpg',NULL,'2026-11-06 00:48:43'),(20585,2687892,'그집식당',39,35,11,'경상북도 안동시 풍산읍 역전1길 2',NULL,36.58069145,128.56876436,'http://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/82/2684382_image2_1.jpg',NULL,'2026-11-06 00:48:43'),(20586,2687893,'중식당 김사부',39,32,9,'강원특별자치도 원주시 웅비1길 15',NULL,37.32951684,127.98854182,'http://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/36/2701336_image2_1.jpg',NULL,'2026-11-06 00:48:43'),(20587,2687894,'꽃돼지숯불갈비',39,35,11,'경상북도 안동시 광명로 45',NULL,36.55799910,128.69000702,'http://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/83/2684383_image2_1.jpg',NULL,'2026-11-06 00:48:43'),(20588,2687898,'CAFE 에그랑',39,32,9,'강원특별자치도 원주시 황금로 2 1층 108호',NULL,37.32784200,127.98660316,'http://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/37/2701337_image2_1.jpg',NULL,'2026-11-06 00:48:43'),(20589,2687904,'남이곱창전골',39,35,11,'경상북도 안동시 불무골1길 50-11',NULL,36.56600961,128.70688862,'http://tong.vis